Description: AIOHD NEXT 3.2.1 Full HD skin for OpenATV / Python 3
 Rebuilt channel details panel with smaller MiniTV, scrolling multi-line EPG,
 four upcoming events, compact InfoBar with current-event description and inline weather.
 Auto weather uses configured OpenATV Weather Plugin and falls back to current Metrix/Weatherinfo backend; launchers remain selectable.
